Cell["\<\
For c slightly large we still see the single loop.  We can compute it by \
starting with a reasonable initial guess. Tracking out points using starting \
points form nearby parameter values is called homotopy. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000724099817873*^9, 4.0007241168486586`*^9}, {
  4.000724237426118*^9, 4.0007242551609316`*^9}, {4.0007243144904985`*^9, 
  4.000724372052493*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1594f274-c99c-4e11-81ab-\
6efb6e7f83d1"],

